Notes:
- VisionEval.cnf for VERSPM (single stage)
- Model Structural Parameters: ScriptsDir, InputDir, ParamDir, GeoFile, ModelParamFile
- Model Description: VERSPM Valley Model for the San Joaquin Valley Region
- Scenario Description (single stage): Reference, Reference input-level, 2022, 2022 & 2046 model years

# Model Structural Parameters
ScriptsDir     : scripts
InputDir       : inputs
ParamDir       : defs
GeoFile        : geo.csv
ModelParamFile : model_parameters.json # Located in InputDir

# Model description
Model          : VERSPM 3.0
Region         : San Joaquin Valley
State          : CA

# Scenario description (using default or runtime Seed parameter)
Scenario       : VERSPM SJV
Description    : Base Year 2022 + Future 2046
BaseYear       : 2022
Years          : [ 2022, 2046 ]

# Dynamic configuration
VEPopulationSimDir   : VEPopulationSimInputs
